            <a href="/pdf/Pack_TIM.pdf" title="Instructions for Packing a Testhead/EPC TIM">Pack TIM</a>,
            <a href="/pdf/Pack_AUX_Src.pdf" title="Instructions for Packing a Testhead/EPC TIM">Pack AUX TIM
              (RI7725)</a>,
            <a href="/pdf/Exchange_TIM.pdf" title="Instructions for Exchanging a TIM">Exchange TIM</a>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6" style="margin-top: 30px;">
          <section id="google-map">
            <div id="map-canvas">
              <iframe  width="450"  height="550"  style="border:0"  loading="lazy"  allowfullscreen  referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
